# Vercel serves only the Jobify frontend (jobify/). The repo root is the FastAPI backend; without
# this, Vercel auto-detects main.py + requirements.txt as a Python app and tries to install the
# whole backend (the build failed on psycopg2 under Python 3.14). It also keeps backend code and
# data off Vercel's build machines. Build settings: vercel.json (mirrors jobify/vercel.json).
/*
!/jobify
!/vercel.json
!/.vercelignore
/jobify/node_modules
/jobify/dist
/jobify/.env*
!/jobify/.env.example
!/jobify/.env.production.example
